Git
------------------
Git Commands
---------------
1)git --version
2)git config --list :- This will list all the configuration in git
3)Setting the configuration

	git config --global user.name "username"
	git config --global user.email "email-address"
4)How to connect a repo with local folder

    git status :- Used for checking the status of a untracked files
    git add <filename>/./--all :-This will add all files to staging area 
    git commit -m <message>:- Used to add the files to local repo 
    git push -u origin main :- This will transfer files to remote repo  

	